        <fullName>Exclusive_List__c</fullName>
        <defaultValue>false</defaultValue>
        <description>This checkbox controls visibility of the library record in that if it is checked, then it will not appear on the account preferences custom interface. 

In conjunction with this field, we leverage the Library Exception custom metadata object to list which accounts and libraries for which we CAN display library records checked as exclusive ilst = true</description>
        <label>Exclusive List</label>
        <trackHistory>false</trackHistory>
        <trackTrending>false</trackTrending>
        <type>Checkbox</type>
